## Version: 1.3.3

# DaseekiArmoryScanDB is RETIRED as of 1.3.1 and is still declared on purpose.
# Nothing in normal play reads, writes or creates it — the item database is shipped
# in catalog.lua — but a declaration is dropped a couple of releases AFTER its last
# writer, never in the same build, so that a downgrade cannot meet an undeclared
# global and whatever an older build left on disk stays readable. Remove after 1.3.3.

